<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 20: </span>Difference-Awareness: Per-category score extremes for Gemma 2 (27B) across 22 prompt combinations, with decoding stochasticity accounted for by averaging scores over repeated runs.
Both <math id="A1.T20.m53" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{\text{DiffAware}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>DiffAware</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{\text{DiffAware}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.T20.m54" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{\text{CtxtAware}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>CtxtAware</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{\text{CtxtAware}}</annotation></semantics></math> have a range of <math id="A1.T20.m55" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math>, with values closer to 1 indicating better awareness outcomes.
</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
